A B-TREE is not the same as a Binary tree! See Wirth's text Data + Algorithms
= Programs. I asked about B-trees on another bulletin board some time ago and
found that there is no published algorithm. I wrote one myself, but never
completed it. The tricky part is deletion of a record. I will put what I have
in the library in a few days, after I have a chance to rewrite the
documentation so it is readable by others. 
